    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        449,
        766,
        1243,
        806
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, The preponderance of The City of New York's executive legislative and judicial functions are concentrated in the City Hall area of Manhattan, and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.2572,
          "min": -1.2446
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 30,
          "mean": -0.0036,
          "min": -0.101
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 7657,
        "area_px": 32431,
        "density": 0.2361,
        "chars": 154,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 20.11
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        449,
        806,
        1243,
        863
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, The City Hall of New York is a unique structure of immense architectural, historical and cultural importance which must be preserved in its present physical form and setting as a lasting reminder of the great traditions of this City and its people, and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.1827,
          "min": -1.0825
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 48,
          "mean": -0.0014,
          "min": -0.0381
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 11477,
        "area_px": 45878,
        "density": 0.25016,
        "chars": 261,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 22.74
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        449,
        863,
        1243,
        918
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, The volume of the City's governmental activities has grown over the years to the point where the existing facilities in City Hall and nearby municipal buildings unduly restricts the expeditious and efficient performance of these responsibilities, and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.1749,
          "min": -0.9477
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 46,
          "mean": -0.0013,
          "min": -0.0454
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 11170,
        "area_px": 44296,
        "density": 0.25217,
        "chars": 259,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 23.19
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        449,
        918,
        1243,
        975
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, This presents a clear and urgent need for a modern City Hall Annex and other facilities in the Manhattan Civic Center area to permit improvement in the conduct of essential governmental functions, and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.1467,
          "min": -1.132
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0003,
          "min": -0.0003
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 37,
          "mean": -0.0004,
          "min": -0.0125
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 9321,
        "area_px": 45878,
        "density": 0.20317,
        "chars": 209,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 22.42
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        451,
        975,
        1243,
        1014
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, Many complex plans and designs for a modern and efficient Manhattan Civic Center have been formulated in the past, but never brought to fruition, and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 20,
          "mean": -0.157,
          "min": -1.0343
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0001
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 30,
          "mean": -0.0002,
          "min": -0.0025
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 7165,
        "area_px": 30771,
        "density": 0.23285,
        "chars": 158,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 22.05
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        451,
        1014,
        1243,
        1070
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, In addition to servicing the needs of the government of the City of New York, the Manhattan Civic Center area serves as the governmental center for the offices and agencies of the Federal and State governments located within the City of New York, and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1372,
          "min": -0.921
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 49,
          "mean": -0.0002,
          "min": -0.0077
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 11364,
        "area_px": 44973,
        "density": 0.25268,
        "chars": 259,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 22.79
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        451,
        1070,
        1243,
        1148
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, A need exists to insure the proper planning, design, acquisition, construction, development and coordination of the Civic Center and to maintain a close liaison and cooperation with all interested persons and groups, both public and private, including representatives of State and Federal governments and community groups and organizations, and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1158,
          "min": -0.9435
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0002,
          "min": -0.0002
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 59,
          "mean": -0.006,
          "min": -0.347
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 15231,
        "area_px": 62331,
        "density": 0.24436,
        "chars": 353,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 23.18
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        451,
        1148,
        1243,
        1186
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, In addition, the Manhattan Civic Center area will also serve as a focal point for the many events being planned for the City's bicentennial anniversary celebration in 1976.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1631,
          "min": -1.0307
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
