        1505,
        1247,
        1562
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "\u00a7 3. The operating agency for this Task Force shall be the Municipal Service Administration and all members of the Task Force are directed to assist with the personnel and resources deemed necessary by the Chairman to accomplish the objectives of this order.",
      "logprob_stats": {
